<title>JAPAN: Japan Wool rises on solid profit expectations.</title>
<headline>Japan Wool rises on solid profit expectations.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Japan Wool Textile Co Ltd rose in Tokyo on Monday on growing expectations that the company will post better profits, brokers said.</p>
<p>As of 0529 GMT, Japan Wool was up 36 yen to 789 yen in turnover of 413,000 shares, making it the ninth biggest percentage gainer on the first section of the Tokyo Stock Exchange.</p>
